beets
  beets music library manager, packaged with pex as a self-contained
  executable. MIT License. https://github.com/beetbox/beets
  The executable also contains:
  - CPython from python-build-standalone. Python Software Foundation
    License. https://github.com/astral-sh/python-build-standalone
  - the Python dependencies of beets, pyacoustid (MIT), and requests
    (Apache License 2.0), each under its own licence as recorded in its
    package metadata.

